  context-usage.ts,project
  test/context-usage.test.ts,project
  test/coverage-gaps.test.ts,project
  package.json,project
  package-lock.json,project
  dist/context-usage.js,project
  dist/context-usage.d.ts,project
tests[3]{command,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  "parseLedgerLine decodes a well-formed delivery row, including an omitted result",project,pi-agent,"2026-09-05T18:14:18.100Z",local_mutation,fix/recognize-context-usage-delivery-on-pm-cli-2026.9.5
  readLedger does not count a well-formed delivery row as malformed,project,pi-agent,"2026-09-05T18:14:18.100Z",local_mutation,fix/recognize-context-usage-delivery-on-pm-cli-2026.9.5
  buildUsageReport ignores delivery events so they cannot skew serve counts or conversion,project,pi-agent,"2026-09-05T18:14:18.100Z",local_mutation,fix/recognize-context-usage-delivery-on-pm-cli-2026.9.5
close_reason: Pinned pm-cli/pm-ops 2026.9.5 and made context-usage recognize delivery events without folding them into conversion.
